    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>\u00c0rengard-Invasion</u></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a small online party game developed by myself in 2 weeks (LionDev) to learn multiplayer game development in Unreal Engine and how to publish a game on Steam so don't expect too much. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one out of four classes and prepare your castle for the Goblins siege in this &quot;classic&quot; mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Features:</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classes (Archer, Soldier, Mage, Defender) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting (PVE / CO-OP) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control siegeengines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemy classes (Bomber, Soldier, Siegeengines) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn gold</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>\u00c0rengard-Invasion</u></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a small online party game developed by myself in 2 weeks (LionDev) to learn multiplayer game development in Unreal Engine and how to publish a game on Steam so don't expect too much. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one out of four classes and prepare your castle for the Goblins siege in this &quot;classic&quot; mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Features:</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classes (Archer, Soldier, Mage, Defender) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting (PVE / CO-OP) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control siegeengines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemy classes (Bomber, Soldier, Siegeengines) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn gold</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arengard-Invasion is a beat-em-up online-coop game. Swing your sword, shoot a ballista or cast spells to survive the Goblin's siege and keep YOUR beloved gold. Select one out of four classes and prepare your castle for the Goblin's siege",
